--
Recursive member alias template as base-specifier resolves to empty
and the base is dropped (bases()=0); qualified member use in template
bodies then no-bodies the instance.  Root of libc++'s _Or/_And
metaprogram (__libcpp_is_contiguous_iterator), sixth layer of the
vector push_back family (cpp20_vector_basic_libcxx et al.).
Non-recursive member aliases work.  cvise-reduced from a preprocessed
<memory>+<iterator> TU; g++/clang++ runtime-verified.
